Package: bpsuseR
Type: Package
Title: Ready-to-use Time Series Datasets from Badan Pusat Statistik (BPS) Indonesia
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Joko Ade", "Nursiyono", email = "jokoadenursiyono@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
             person("flips24", role = "ctb"))
Description: Provides convenient access to ready-to-use time series datasets
    from Badan Pusat Statistik (BPS) Indonesia. This package helps researchers,
    analysts, and students easily access, analyze, and visualize macroeconomic,
    social, and regional indicators such as GDP (ADHK and ADHB), inflation,
    population, and other statistical data.
